# D3-PO-003: A PVA network requires both polymer and borate
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 water 30mL
add v1 PVA 1g
add v1 Na2B4O7 0.03g
add v2 water 30mL
add v2 PVA 1g
add v3 water 30mL
add v3 Na2B4O7 0.03g
stir v1 300rpm 30s
stir v2 300rpm 30s
stir v3 300rpm 30s
look v1
look v2
look v3
particles v1
inspect
